{{cit|a|r}} It is available solely for {{c|Tainted ???}} as his starting item.

== Effects ==
* Removes {{C|Tainted ???}}'s leftmost [[Bombs#Poop|poop]], storing it inside of Hold and cycling to the next poop.
* Using Hold again while a poop is inside it will remove the poop and use it as expected.

== Notes ==
* The item is unavailable for anyone except {{C|Tainted ???}}.
** It can, however, activate when using {{i|Metronome}}. This does nothing with most characters; however, it ''will'' count as a use of the item when activated as {{C|Tainted ???}}.

